2. Information We Collect
We collect information that you provide directly to us, information that is collected automatically when you use the App, and information from third-party sources as described in this Privacy Policy.

2.1 Location Data
The App collects location data to provide and improve its core functionality. The specific types of location information we collect include:

Precise Location Data: GPS coordinates and other sensor data from your mobile device that provide information about your precise geographic location.
Approximate Location Data: Information about your general location derived from IP address, cell tower triangulation, or WiFi network positioning.
Location History: A record of the places your device has been, which may be stored temporarily or persistently depending on your settings and use of the App.
We collect location data only when you have granted permission through your device settings. You can control location permissions at any time through your device's operating system settings.

