Access Controls: We restrict access to personal information to employees, contractors, and agents who need to know that information to operate, develop, or improve our App. These individuals are bound by confidentiality obligations.
Secure Development: We follow secure coding practices and conduct regular security reviews of our code and infrastructure.
Monitoring: We monitor our systems for potential security vulnerabilities and attacks.
Incident Response: We maintain an incident response plan to address security breaches promptly and effectively.
8.2 Your Responsibility
